  "notes": "Total time, including resting: 50 min.\n\nOptional substitutions: aquavit → vodka or brandy; dark raisins → golden raisins\n\nMake-ahead and storage: To make glögg ahead of time, remove the spice bag after step 3, then allow the mixture to cool to room temperature. Transfer to an airtight container and refrigerate for up to 3 days. Reheat in a 3-quart saucier until warm, but do not let it boil.",
